  "description": "Upgrade your interior protection with OEDRO custom floor mats for the 2024–2026 Chevy Trax and Buick Envista. Engineered using precision 3D scanning, this full mat set delivers a factory-style fit that blends seamlessly with your vehicle’s interior while providing dependable all-weather defense.\nCrafted from GRS-certified recyclable TPE, these mats are safe, odor-free, and tough enough for daily driving, family use, and pets. The included trunk mat with backrest coverage adds an extra layer of protection when hauling cargo or folding down rear seats. From muddy boots to accidental spills, OEDRO keeps your cabin clean, comfortable, and looking new—mile after mile.\nFeatures\nPrecision Custom Fit: Designed with advanced 3D laser scanning for a glove-like fit, ensuring full coverage without pedal interference for safer driving.\nAll-Weather TPE Protection: Made from GRS-certified recyclable TPE material that is durable, odorless, and pet-friendly—built to handle rain, snow, mud, and spills year-round.\nTrunk Mat with Backrest Coverage: Includes a trunk mat with back seat backrest protection to guard against stains, scratches, and cargo damage when seats are folded.\nAnti-Slip & Easy to Clean: Raised edges fully contain dirt and liquids, while the anti-slip surface keeps mats securely in place; simply remove, rinse, and reinstall.\nTrusted OEDRO Quality: Backed by over 10 years of experience in automotive floor liners, covering 300+ vehicle models with reliable US-based customer support.\n2 years warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2024–2026 Chevy Trax & Buick Envista\nCargo/trunk mat fit may vary due to cargo volume differences",
  "highlights": [
    "Premium Interior Protection: OEDRO Floor mats trap dirt, debris, and liquids to keep your vehicle floor clean and protected.",
    "Secure Driving Confidence: Anti-slip texture keeps mats firmly in place, helping ensure a safer and more stable ride.",
    "Built to Last: Durable, recyclable Thermoplastic Elastomer construction delivers long-term protection with easy maintenance."
  ],
